{"id":"fjehvdxmlik2j58nzhmo61hzd","title":"AI音乐数据标注的三种商业模式及行业影响","originalTitle":"AI音乐的数据标注生意","summary":"AI音乐数据标注衍生出人力服务、专业评测与数据资产三种商业模式。灵动音科技通过标注服务接入全民K歌，MOSS-Music开源8B音乐模型并配套标注流水线，Deezer平台日均AI生成歌曲达9万首但播放率不足3%。音乐标注师需求随技术路线分化：结构化标注转向自动化，专业评测岗位仍依赖音乐人。周深等音乐人通过声明维权，暴露AI训练数据版权争议。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15347817.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-18T11:12:57.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-18T12:07:01.247Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-18T12:07:01.247Z","category":"macro","tags":["研究报告"],"score":62,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"fad51d28-50ec-4672-9aea-ae774ba5ec27","title":"AI音乐标注引发版权争议及商业模式分化"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(数智奔流)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"fad51d28-50ec-4672-9aea-ae774ba5ec27","title":"AI音乐标注引发版权争议及商业模式分化"}],"topics":[{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f20yCfZtcIdQ","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}